WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.668
- They do a really good job of

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:03.706
you know always telling me
that they're proud of me

00:00:03.706 --> 00:00:06.111
and that they love me,
oh my gosh I'm sorry.

00:00:06.111 --> 00:00:09.194
(mellow piano music)

00:00:23.225 --> 00:00:25.280
- Should I mention
something that I wrote here?

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:26.113
- [Interviewer] Sure please.

00:00:26.113 --> 00:00:27.421
- I wrote a little cheat sheet.

00:00:27.421 --> 00:00:29.631
- Since our daughter was a baby up to now

00:00:29.631 --> 00:00:31.381
we call her our PB&amp;J.

00:00:32.277 --> 00:00:35.155
The J stands for joy because
she has brought us joy,

00:00:35.155 --> 00:00:38.557
not only to her parents but
also to friends and relatives.

00:00:38.557 --> 00:00:41.795
The B stands for beautiful,
for being beautiful person

00:00:41.795 --> 00:00:45.080
not only on the outside but
most specially on the inside.

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:48.314
The P stands for proud
because she makes us proud

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:50.921
not only the type of person she is

00:00:50.921 --> 00:00:54.454
but because of her positive
attitude in life and character.

00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:56.886
- Talented, beautiful, funny, exacting,

00:00:56.886 --> 00:01:00.662
multi-ethnic, goofy, loud, cat-loving,

00:01:00.662 --> 00:01:04.760
altogether original, and did
I mention funny? (laughs)

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:08.927
If I had been asked to design
a daughter before she was born

00:01:10.913 --> 00:01:13.080
I would have fallen short.

00:01:13.955 --> 00:01:18.436
She is so much more than I
could ever have imagined.

00:01:18.436 --> 00:01:21.879
And, yeah, she's hilarious. (laughs)

00:01:21.879 --> 00:01:24.833
- We build up our relationship,
like they all say,

00:01:24.833 --> 00:01:26.879
"Mom, you're like not like other mom,

00:01:26.879 --> 00:01:27.942
"you're like friend to us."

00:01:27.942 --> 00:01:31.887
After he moved to USA,
you know I miss him a lot

00:01:31.887 --> 00:01:33.548
but he does not come home very often.

00:01:33.548 --> 00:01:36.113
Even I never really just go bother him

00:01:36.113 --> 00:01:37.954
to drive over to their,

00:01:37.954 --> 00:01:39.355
say lets go out, this and.

00:01:39.355 --> 00:01:42.443
I think he need his time to settle.

00:01:42.443 --> 00:01:46.788
But recently, the second semester
he sometimes he come home.

00:01:46.788 --> 00:01:49.051
He just want to come home.

00:01:49.051 --> 00:01:50.344
I'm glad. (laughs)

00:01:50.344 --> 00:01:52.756
- When I came to the
airport to pick her up

00:01:52.756 --> 00:01:54.214
because she came from Korea.

00:01:54.214 --> 00:01:57.335
They had told me that
she was crying a lot and

00:01:57.335 --> 00:01:59.759
that not to feel bad that
she wouldn't want me.

00:01:59.759 --> 00:02:02.867
The minute I held her in
my arms, she was quiet.

00:02:02.867 --> 00:02:04.282
It was magic. (laughs)

00:02:04.282 --> 00:02:05.809
I'd never change anything,

00:02:05.809 --> 00:02:07.587
and I certainly couldn't have done better.

00:02:07.587 --> 00:02:12.117
I think she is a beautiful
gal who has grown up.

00:02:12.117 --> 00:02:14.887
She's had her challenges, that's for sure.

00:02:14.887 --> 00:02:16.587
But she's really,

00:02:16.587 --> 00:02:18.254
knows who she is and

00:02:19.416 --> 00:02:21.656
she's just become a wonderful young lady,

00:02:21.656 --> 00:02:22.899
I think young adult.

00:02:22.899 --> 00:02:26.254
One piece of wisdom that I
would really like to impart.

00:02:26.254 --> 00:02:28.754
I really don't like this thing

00:02:29.639 --> 00:02:30.472
(laughs)

00:02:30.472 --> 00:02:33.332
through dinner the whole time.

00:02:33.332 --> 00:02:36.619
(mellow guitar music)

00:02:36.619 --> 00:02:38.225
- Surprise!

00:02:38.225 --> 00:02:39.058
- Oh no!

00:02:40.116 --> 00:02:42.428
- Oh my god! (laughs)

00:02:42.428 --> 00:02:43.880
- Oh you're here?

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:46.194
Oh my god. (laughs)

00:02:46.194 --> 00:02:47.575
- Oh that's my daughter.

00:02:47.575 --> 00:02:48.629
- Is this texting?

00:02:48.629 --> 00:02:50.029
Is this what you meant?

00:02:50.029 --> 00:02:50.862
Is this?

00:02:50.862 --> 00:02:51.695
- Yeah.

00:02:51.695 --> 00:02:55.612
- Oh okay, I was like
what does that even mean?

00:03:01.249 --> 00:03:03.465
- I got her, I got her.

00:03:03.465 --> 00:03:04.526
- Ah!

00:03:04.526 --> 00:03:05.359
- Hi!

00:03:05.359 --> 00:03:06.192
- Hi!

00:03:06.192 --> 00:03:07.964
- That was sweet, thank you.
- Did you hear that?

00:03:07.964 --> 00:03:08.797
- Yeah.

00:03:08.797 --> 00:03:09.630
(laughs)

00:03:09.630 --> 00:03:10.706
It was really sweet.

00:03:10.706 --> 00:03:12.340
- You're gonna make me cry.

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:13.496
- No you made me cry.

00:03:13.496 --> 00:03:16.228
- Oh 'cause I know, you and dad

00:03:16.228 --> 00:03:20.113
you guys traveled such a far
distance to get over here

00:03:20.113 --> 00:03:22.145
and I just wanna make
you guys really proud.

00:03:22.145 --> 00:03:23.083
I love you so much.

00:03:23.083 --> 00:03:25.407
Thank you so much for
everything you do for me.

00:03:25.407 --> 00:03:26.879
I think about you everyday.

00:03:26.879 --> 00:03:28.179
- Oh thank you honey.

00:03:28.179 --> 00:03:30.193
- I was celebrating for the first part

00:03:30.193 --> 00:03:31.589
'cause I was like that's right.

00:03:31.589 --> 00:03:32.862
I knew she was gonna say that.

00:03:32.862 --> 00:03:36.734
And then the last part,
when she said I was like,

00:03:36.734 --> 00:03:37.847
when she was grateful for me,

00:03:37.847 --> 00:03:40.188
and that I'm a blessing in her life.

00:03:40.188 --> 00:03:41.330
It's nice to hear.

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:43.397
- I wouldn't be who I am without you.

00:03:43.397 --> 00:03:45.564
- I'm a very proud of you,

00:03:47.263 --> 00:03:48.646
and a

00:03:48.646 --> 00:03:52.245
he's a very mature child, very mature and,

00:03:52.245 --> 00:03:54.857
very responsible kind of
person you can rely on,

00:03:54.857 --> 00:03:55.827
you can trust.

00:03:55.827 --> 00:03:57.214
- It was really sweet.

00:03:57.214 --> 00:03:59.790
It's always nice to hear what
your mom thinks about you.

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:01.914
She always tells me I'm
great but now I know it's,

00:04:01.914 --> 00:04:02.747
it's for real.
- It's the truth.

00:04:02.747 --> 00:04:03.941
- It's the truth now.

00:04:03.941 --> 00:04:05.774
- I'm just really proud
to be your daughter.

00:04:05.774 --> 00:04:07.279
You're one of my biggest inspirations,

00:04:07.279 --> 00:04:08.464
if not the biggest.

00:04:08.464 --> 00:04:09.385
- I love you.

00:04:09.385 --> 00:04:10.895
- I love you too.

00:04:10.895 --> 00:04:12.253
- Yeah I've very lucky.

00:04:12.253 --> 00:04:15.420
